The forms plugin has been reworked to unify the API with forms in the "ActaNove Dialog Portal":https://www.gentics.com/guides/latest/andp/. Forms are now rendered using ANDPs "FormGen":https://www.gentics.com/guides/latest/andp/customizing/formgen/ React App. For details on how to integrate the forms plugin with CMP, see the "Gentics CMS Forms":https://www.gentics.com/Content.Node/cmp8/guides/feature_forms.html feature documentation.